          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question_1": "Benefits",
            "faq_answer_1": "<p>An authentic Greek extra virgin olive oil made from hand-harvested Koroneiki olives, naturally rich in anti-inflammatory polyphenols and  cold-pressed for full flavor and health benefits. Crafted  for everyday use — this is the olive oil you pour, cook with, and finish your meals with, while still nourishing your gut, heart, and  metabolism.</p><ul><li>Supports digestion and gut comfort</li><li>Promotes healthy cholesterol and heart protection</li><li>Helps reduce everyday inflammation</li><li>Aids metabolism and weight control</li><li>Rich in antioxidants for cellular protection</li><li>Encourages nutrient absorption from meals</li><li>A flavorful way to support long-term health</li></ul>",
